		<p>To use the armrest, pull it forward from the seatback.</p>
		<p>An adjustable armrest is located on the center of 2nd row seatback. To use the armrest, pull it forward from the seatback and adjust it to desired angle. Pull the armrest backward to lock it in place.</p>
